{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10271100","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10271100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1027110001:1":{"text":"바닥에 새로 찍힌 바퀴 자국과 오래된 바퀴 자국이 수없이 교차하네요... 다미안은 여기에 처음 온 게 아닌 것 같아요.","source_cn":"地上有不少车辙印，新旧交织……看来达米安不是第一次来这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FD69F89081580FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1027110002:1":{"text":"게다가 이렇게 외진 곳에 널려 있는 기믹이라니.","source_cn":"而且，这么偏僻的地方，还布置了不少机关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F59C5A39FF137AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1027110002":{"text":"게다가 이렇게 외진 곳에 널려 있는 기믹이라니.","source_cn":"而且，这么偏僻的地方，还布置了不少机关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F59C5A39FF137AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1027110003:1":{"text":"...그게 더 이상하잖아요!","source_cn":"——那就更可疑了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29DE6C1C6A7715DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1027110004:1":{"text":"왜 친구를 이런 곳에서 만나는 거죠? 설마 함정을 실험해볼 사람을 찾는 건가...","source_cn":"为什么要约朋友在这种地方见面？他该不会是想找人来实验陷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF96335AF53B3765","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1027110005:1":{"text":"그러고 보니 근처에 다른 인간이나 와일더스의 발자국은 찾지 못했어요. 다미안의 친구는 아직 안 온 걸까요?","source_cn":"说起来，这附近没有发现其他人类或绿裔的脚印。达米安的朋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x751BF7785BF59037","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1027110006:1":{"text":"로잔, 잘 들어봐. 다미안이 아직 근처에 있어?","source_cn":"洛桑，你认真听听，达米安还在这附近吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3BA43FB4D5C7119","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1027110007:1":{"text":"응...","source_cn":"嗯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83FC67B4EA31E0B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1027110008:1":{"text":"멀지 않은 곳에 있어. 근처에 이상한 소리도 없으니 아직은 안전해.","source_cn":"他就在前面不远处，附近也没有异响，暂时安全。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E90A9FBE83F9C65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1027110008":{"text":"멀지 않은 곳에 있어. 근처에 이상한 소리도 없으니 아직은 안전해.","source_cn":"他就在前面不远处，附近也没有异响，暂时安全。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E90A9FBE83F9C65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say